 "remarks": "Unique and Charming cottage on large, historic West Norwalk property. Electricity, Heat and Hot water INCLUDED in the base rental (reflecting a net rental of $3200/month!) It is a private sanctuary while only 2.5 miles to downtown New Canaan and minutes from Target, Wegmans, Costco and the Darien Trader Joes. Spacious eat in kitchen with dishwasher and private in unit laundry. Window unit for air conditioning included. Plenty of outdoor space for your use. 2 bedrooms and 2 baths (with clawfoot tub!), hardwood floors and a beautiful covered deck overlooking the property. Plenty of FREE off street parking. No additional fee for pets!",
